WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.272 --> 00:00:11.557
Rava: my name is Rava the Lava.

2
00:00:12.097 --> 00:00:14.258
Careful! Don't touch me.

3
00:00:14.278 --> 00:00:18.980
Rava: See, I am one thousand degrees Celsius.

4
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:20.461
I'm hot!

5
00:00:20.481 --> 00:00:23.742
Rava: This is my friend Java the Lava.

6
00:00:24.242 --> 00:00:25.583
She's hot too.

7
00:00:26.083 --> 00:00:26.663
Java: Hi there!

8
00:00:27.063 --> 00:00:28.204
It's nice to meet you.

9
00:00:30.128 --> 00:00:31.690
Rava: We are not from here.

10
00:00:32.170 --> 00:00:34.892
We come from a very different place.

11
00:00:35.613 --> 00:00:38.696
Java: Hey Rava, let's tell them how we got here.

12
00:00:38.716 --> 00:00:41.198
Rava: That's a great idea!

13
00:00:42.359 --> 00:00:44.861
Today, we came out of a volcano.

14
00:00:44.881 --> 00:00:50.085
Rava: Before that, we were magma, which means melted rock.

15
00:00:50.105 --> 00:00:53.068
Rava: We are from deep in the earth.

16
00:00:53.088 --> 00:00:57.352
Java: Let's go have a look!

17
00:00:57.932 --> 00:01:02.853
Java: When you travel down into the earth, it gets hotter and hotter.

18
00:01:02.873 --> 00:01:07.535
Java: Thirty kilometers down, all the rock is melted.

19
00:01:07.555 --> 00:01:12.396
Rava: Down here used to be our home.

20
00:01:13.096 --> 00:01:14.857
We lived here with the magma.

21
00:01:14.877 --> 00:01:17.518
Rava: Everything is very hot.

22
00:01:18.438 --> 00:01:21.519
Java: When rock turns into magma, it makes gas.

23
00:01:21.539 --> 00:01:24.940
Java: It becomes very crowded down here.

24
00:01:25.612 --> 00:01:28.334
Java: So the gas pushes us up to the surface.

25
00:01:28.354 --> 00:01:34.017
Java: The gas and the magma try to find cracks in the earth's crust.

26
00:01:34.037 --> 00:01:37.899
Java: We push everywhere until we find a crack.

27
00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:43.002
Rava: Hey guys, I found a crack over here!

28
00:01:43.022 --> 00:01:47.304
Rava: When we find a crack in the crust, we climb up it.

29
00:01:48.945 --> 00:01:53.628
Java: We rise and we rise, pushing through the earth.

30
00:01:54.268 --> 00:01:55.749
Rava: It is hard work.

31
00:01:56.489 --> 00:02:00.251
But soon we are almost at the surface of the earth.

32
00:02:00.712 --> 00:02:07.315
Java: When we get to the top, we all work together and [n3@push through the earth's crust.

33
00:02:07.816 --> 00:02:08.396
Rava: Push!

34
00:02:10.237 --> 00:02:15.220
We push so hard that we fly up high into the sky.

35
00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:16.640
Java: Whee!

36
00:02:17.021 --> 00:02:18.762
We have made it to the surface.

37
00:02:18.782 --> 00:02:20.943
Rava: It is much cooler here.

38
00:02:20.963 --> 00:02:24.517
Ah, I like it here.

39
00:02:24.537 --> 00:02:30.519
Java: Up here the gas, the air, and the magma all mix into one.

40
00:02:30.539 --> 00:02:32.820
Java: Together they make lava.

41
00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:35.401
Rava: That is how we got here today.

42
00:02:35.421 --> 00:02:41.183
Rava: Most people do not like lava because we destroy their cities.

43
00:02:41.203 --> 00:02:44.525
Java: But we did not know there was a city here!

44
00:02:44.545 --> 00:02:46.085
Rava: Watch out!

45
00:02:46.345 --> 00:02:47.346
Get out of the way!

46
00:02:47.766 --> 00:02:48.846
We can't stop.

47
00:02:48.866 --> 00:02:52.768
Java: Now we are beginning to cool down.

48
00:02:53.528 --> 00:02:54.949
Rava: Soon we will become rock.

49
00:02:54.969 --> 00:02:59.270
Rava: Then, we will be part of a volcanic mountain.

50
00:02:59.290 --> 00:03:02.772
Java: Volcanoes make very large mountains.

51
00:03:02.792 --> 00:03:08.774
Rava: Many mountains were made by lava that cooled into rock.

52
00:03:08.794 --> 00:03:13.596
Java: There are the Smokey Mountains in the eastern United States.

53
00:03:13.616 --> 00:03:16.517
Rava: There is Mount Kenya in Africa.

54
00:03:16.977 --> 00:03:18.998
Java: And many, many more.

55
00:03:20.139 --> 00:03:22.780
Sometimes volcanoes erupt in the ocean.

56
00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:26.563
Java: When this happens, a new island is made.

57
00:03:26.583 --> 00:03:30.726
Rava: The islands of Hawaii were made from a volcano.

58
00:03:30.746 --> 00:03:36.931
Rava: Long ago, magma pushed through the earth's crust under the ocean.

59
00:03:36.951 --> 00:03:42.216
Rava: When the lava cooled, the new islands of Hawaii were born.

60
00:03:42.236 --> 00:03:44.578
Rava: We must say good-bye.

61
00:03:45.118 --> 00:03:46.620
We are becoming hard.

62
00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:48.842
Soon we will be rock.

63
00:03:48.862 --> 00:03:50.143
Java: Good-bye!

64
00:03:50.163 --> 00:03:51.484
Rava: So long!
